-Evaluation.md\", \"id\": \"1bf20e29588ed1d1\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2706932606620691, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.08939221237438441, \"vector_similarity\": 0.69372904, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-31-GUI-Desktop-Wrapper-Evaluation.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"eec486b88a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-31-GUI-Desktop-Wrapper-Evaluation.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-31-GUI-Desktop-Wrapper-Evaluation.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1458, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:05:22\", \"token_count\": 531, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-25\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Title**: Batch Processing Fail-Closed Strategy\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nImplement fail-closed behavior for the batch engine so a processing failure never releases an unredacted output file (WS-04). Bob completed the implementation on 2026-06-15. On 2026-07-16 Diana's QA pass validated the fail-closed behavior - confirming no output file is produced on failure and that temp files are securely deleted - ahead of the encryption (T021) and offline-mode (T027) work that depends on it.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-25\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Title**: Batch Processing Fail-Closed Strategy\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Fail-closed implementation completed (2026-06-15).\\n